Static review / change made
---------------------------
Inspected docker/Dockerfile, requirements-lock.txt, .dockerignore, Makefile,
and .github/workflows/build.yml. The liboqs CMake configure previously relied
on the platform default library directory and OpenSSL discovery. The Dockerfile
now explicitly installs liboqs into /usr/local/lib64 and sets
OPENSSL_ROOT_DIR=/usr/local, matching the later MTL link/runtime paths and the
OpenSSL built in the image. This is a source-level correction, not proof that
the image builds.

